<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Senate passes bill on shareholders rights.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Senate passes bill on shareholders rights.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Senate approved a bill that alters existing legislation on shareholders rights and helps pave the way for privatization of the power and telecom sectors, an official said.</p>
<p>The Senate approved the bill in a show of hands. The legislation, which has already been approved in the Chamber of Deputies, requires a signature by President Fernando Henrique Cardoso before becoming law.</p>
</text>
